&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 9, 47); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Pediatric Home Care Nurse Needed – Make a Real Difference&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking compassionate and skilled nurses to care for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;184&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;pediatric female client&lt;/strong&gt; who will be &lt;strong data-start=&quot;224&quot; data-end=&quot;289&quot;&gt;coming home soon and is tracheostomy and ventilator dependent&lt;/strong&gt;. This is a meaningful opportunity to provide 1:1 care and truly impact a child’s life in the comfort of her home&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
